<p>Alweda alweda alweda<br />
Aye sibte payambar Alweda alweda alweda</p>

<p>1. Kuch kar na sake hum jee bhar ke ziyafat<br />
Phir rehgayi hasrat Alweda alweda alweda</p>

<p>2. Aye lashkare jarrar zainab ki aye talwaar<br />
Abbase alamdaar Alweda alweda alweda</p>

<p>
3. Jaane dile madar shabbier ke dilbar<br />
Ham shakle payambar Alweda alweda alweda</p>

<p>4. Kubra hui&rsquo;n bewa do lamho&rsquo;n ka dulha<br />
Aye qasime noushah Alweda alweda alweda</p>

<p>5. Aye bolte quraa&rsquo;n aye faqre rasulaa&rsquo;n<br />
Aye shahe shaheedaa&rsquo;n Alweda alweda alweda</p>

<p>6. Garden teri aur teer aye nanhe se shabbier<br />
Aye asghare besheer Alweda alweda alweda</p>

<p>7. Jaane se tumhaare ab na rahi rounaq<br />
Aur hogaye dil shaq Alweda alweda alweda</p>

<p>8. Hai gham hamei&rsquo;n behad aye faqre abo jad<br />
Aye aon o mohammad Alweda alweda alweda</p>

<p>9. Aye qwahare masoom jaane shahe mazloom<br />
Aye zainab o kulsoom Alweda alweda alweda</p>

<p>
<center><h4>Kalaam : Ustaad e Suqan Janab Hassan Abidi Sahab</h4></center></p>
